1. City Council amend City of Toronto Zoning by-law 569-2013 for the lands at 985 Woodbine Avenue and 2078, 2086, 2100, 2102 and 2106 Danforth Avenue, substantially in accordance with the draft Zoning By-law Amendment included as Attachment 6 to this report.

