1. City Council amend City of Toronto Zoning By-law 569-2013 for the portion of the lands municipally known as 123 Garratt Boulevard subject to the Zoning By-law Amendment application (City File 22 148540 NNY 06 OZ) substantially in accordance with the draft Zoning By-law Amendment included as Attachment 10 to this Report.

