The City Planning Division recommends that:

1. City Council amend City of Toronto Zoning By-law 569-2013 for the lands at 632-652 Northcliffe Boulevard substantially in accordance with the draft Zoning By-law Amendment included Attachment 7 to this report.

2. City Council amend former City of York Zoning By-law 1-83 for the lands at 632-652 Northcliffe Boulevard substantially in accordance with the draft Zoning By-law Amendment included as Attachment 8 to this report.

3. City Council authorizes the City Solicitor to make such stylistic and technical changes to the draft Zoning By-law Amendment as may be required.

4. City Council approve the Rental Housing Demolition application (22 218880 STE 12 RH) under Chapter 667 of the Toronto Municipal Code pursuant to Section 111 of the City of Toronto Act, 2006 to permit the demolition of 9 existing rental dwelling units at 632-652 Northcliffe Boulevard, subject to the following conditions:

